    "Cute coffeehouse in the area with reasonable prices and pretty good matcha. The matcha latte is slightly chalky but I still enjoyed it and appreciate how they use ceremonial grade. Bourbon vanilla was a nice touch. Great atmosphere and pretty quiet and suitable for working."
